[{"client_msg_id":"28712c06-aa69-4b6c-b4e6-c630aeaadba7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Avoid Export Default の日本語版には `export defaultは有害だと考えられます` って最初に書かれているけど、英語版にはそんなこと一言も書かれていない (もしかしたら更新で消えたのかもしれないけど)","ts":"1631113199.204000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jn3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2aa6c375-a447-4c9a-8440-2a17ffdb77a6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それだ。Avoid Export Default も原文は英語なので問題なし","ts":"1631113077.203200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MVotH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1419427-8083-4e41-930a-bbc574b7bb7c","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"つまり英語で書けば解決","ts":"1631113009.202700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VX3cx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69fa5848-52cd-41e9-b76a-6d9137bcc45e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"主張が正しいかどうかはどうでもよくて、強い言葉を使うと読み手に警戒心を与えてしまう","ts":"1631112700.202400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uJVt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a170706-9f2e-45d7-8a0a-4c4496ea8b89","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"元の Avoid Export Default がそもそも強めだったから、そのアンサーという前提知識ありで読んだので、とくに気にならなかった","ts":"1631112531.201800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QKt8R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0da8e332-1f00-461e-a292-c39d0fa77e6b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"相手を納得させたいのであれば強い言葉は使うべきではないと言う学びを改めて得られた","ts":"1631111574.200200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qMXdL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bfd3fdb-d7f7-4108-a923-d4f3a36ba438","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"不快な気持ちになるだろうなと思ってそもそも読んでないのでもう少しちくちくしない文法で書いてほしい","ts":"1631107139.199700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JKi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05399c1c-3a96-45bf-8d59-17ee192f28d2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分が default export を避けているのは auto-import やリファクタリングがしづらい点だったので、改めて考える切っ掛けにはなりましたね。（文体はもうちょっとなんとか。とは思いますが）\nとはいえ、意見を変えるには至らなかった。今後も named を使っていきます。","ts":"1631106910.198700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fvRm9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ee63ecc-5f1f-484a-971a-40139425e027","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですねえ、ちょっと語が強いな...","ts":"1631106578.197200","thread_ts":"1631105501.196300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BgW"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"6932be84-2457-4e9d-9fc1-52ff304ff572","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"まぁしかし燃えそうな書き方なエントリーだな。","ts":"1631105501.196300","thread_ts":"1631105501.196300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JO0p"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"dc0cd723-46de-4224-9da1-41c14f694d61","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"文体で燃やしに行ってる感ありますよねw","ts":"1631105530.197000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dzBF/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6932be84-2457-4e9d-9fc1-52ff304ff572","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"まぁしかし燃えそうな書き方なエントリーだな。","ts":"1631105501.196300","thread_ts":"1631105501.196300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JO0p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce7893d7-e887-48e6-a90c-5725392a7d27","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"下のstar importはだいぶhackしてる感","ts":"1631105375.195500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pVqOn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af0617ff-909b-47ed-8957-76db3ace9480","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"したのは `component.Props;`?","ts":"1631105343.195000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BPjxe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ba87ec6-bfc6-42a1-b43e-2c13032ac038","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```import Component from \"asdf.ts\";\nComponent.Props;```\n```import * as component from \"asdf.ts\";\ncomponent.props;```\nだから default export のハック的な使い方だなぁ...と思った。こうなるなら素直に named にしといたほうが良いんじゃないかなというのが個人的な感想","ts":"1631105174.193500","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1631105210.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aP5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da748e4c-76c8-4050-9c21-3a90981f5879","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"自分が書くアプリのコードは React の fast refresh なところはやむおえず default export それ以外はだいたい named export","ts":"1631105090.193100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BppM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d209aea-816a-4919-8696-203c7c87f0f8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"識別子名の変更にどこまで default export で対応できるのか。。。　自分も named 一択でずっとやってますね。","ts":"1631104840.190000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CHK6="}]},{"client_msg_id":"4EFEE9EB-947E-4632-9817-2D639B25B027","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"できるだけnamedにしたい気持ちがある","ts":"1631104823.189600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+yy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4aec367f-0b9f-46d7-8620-b9d44ceaf825","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なるほど。匿名 default export という概念があったのか。","ts":"1631104796.188700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false